msgid "joke/event_1"
msgstr "If your dog ever starts glowing, report to medical. Or don't. You didn't hear this from me."

msgid "joke/event_10"
msgstr "The dog passed swim class with flying colors. The soldier? Not so much."

msgid "joke/event_11"
msgstr "It was a tactical extraction... of snacks."

msgid "joke/event_12"
msgstr "Who needs snake repellents when you have a tail that wags and a bark that scares?"

msgid "joke/event_13"
msgstr "Hoarding junk? No way, more like curating morale-boosting artifacts!"

msgid "joke/event_14"
msgstr "We don't know what it runs on, but we’re guessing tennis balls and chaos."

msgid "joke/event_15"
msgstr "Forget mine detectors, sometimes all you need is sharp eyes and a wagging tail."

msgid "joke/event_16"
msgstr "Your dog has officially become the squad's most reliable food scout."

msgid "joke/event_17"
msgstr "Nobody knows where it came from, but morale’s up and cheese supplies are down."

msgid "joke/event_18"
msgstr "Their last transmission? \"Bark once for danger, twice for reload.\""

msgid "joke/event_19"
msgstr "He wasn’t trespassing. He was just very lost. And armed."

msgid "joke/event_2"
msgstr "Looks like someone finally cracked the secret to speeding up bureaucracy—four paws and no questions."

msgid "joke/event_20"
msgstr "Forget sensors—install a dog next to every pipe instead."

msgid "joke/event_21"
msgstr "You know it's serious when a dog has better supply chains than the logistics team."

msgid "joke/event_22"
msgstr "Not even our top mechanics passed the wrench that fast."

msgid "joke/event_23"
msgstr "When nature strikes, send in the bark unit."

msgid "joke/event_24"
msgstr "The only crew member to officially qualify as both \"combat ready\" and \"a very good doggy.\""

msgid "joke/event_25"
msgstr "Hey, if the toy starts moving on its own… it's your shift now."

msgid "joke/event_26"
msgstr "Live ammo at training? Good thing your dog double-checks."

msgid "joke/event_27"
msgstr "Recruit of the month: four legs, no shovel, lots of dirt."

msgid "joke/event_28"
msgstr "Calling a dog a \"chef\" is a stretch, but tails make for excellent stirring tools."

msgid "joke/event_29"
msgstr "Doctor's orders: Two sets of pills and one good pupper per room."

msgid "joke/event_3"
msgstr "No forklift license, but still plenty of drive."

msgid "joke/event_30"
msgstr "Mopping? Check. Dusting? Check. Shedding? Double check. Housekeeping approved!"

msgid "joke/event_4"
msgstr "Your dog either found a secret stash… or decided to set up a whole new garage."

msgid "joke/event_5"
msgstr "Turns out, the most effective formula for crowd dispersal is fermented fish plus four legs."

msgid "joke/event_6"
msgstr "A dog and a cat working together? The apocalypse must be ahead of schedule."

msgid "joke/event_7"
msgstr "If your dog starts guarding spare parts, don't worry—it just wants a promotion to junior mechanic."

msgid "joke/event_8"
msgstr "What do you call a howling dog under a full moon? A \"werewhine.\""

msgid "joke/event_9"
msgstr "Fire drills save lives. Dogs, apparently, save crews."

msgid "rewards/synergy_value"
msgstr "+"

msgid "rewards/title"
msgstr "Lost, but not gone:"

msgid "submit"
msgstr "Got it!"

msgid "text/event_1"
msgstr "A stranger in a formal suit approaches you. \"Your dog has assisted in the search and containment of a dangerous object. The data about this incident will be deleted from all logs. Thank you for your assistance.\" The man hands you a package and leaves the Garage."

msgid "text/event_10"
msgstr "During a combat exercise on the water, one of the soldiers got tangled in the mooring ropes and fell in. Luckily, your dog was nearby and managed to pull the drowning man to safety. The story quickly became a symbol of courage throughout the unit."

msgid "text/event_11"
msgstr "You noticed your dog running out of the warehouse with a small bag in its mouth. As you prepared to scold him for stealing supplies, the custodian chuckled, \"I can't help but forgive such a good pooch.\" Looks like some extra training in manners couldn't hurt, though."

msgid "text/event_12"
msgstr "During a routine inspection, soldiers discovered a snake nest near one of the barracks. While they deliberated on how to handle it, your faithful dog drove the reptiles away with barking and fearless pouncing. By the evening, the area was safe again. Your dog's courage is sure to be rewarded."

msgid "text/event_13"
msgstr "You noticed that your dog would occasionally run off someplace in the morning. It turns out that some pilots have a tradition of petting the pup for good luck before takeoff. Curious, you followed your tail-wagging friend and discovered a secret stash—a small chest filled with bottle caps, buttons, and chewed-up socks."

msgid "text/event_14"
msgstr "Your dog found a strange device in an old garage. After it was turned on, the device began processing the toys inside it, creating completely new items. During all the transformations, you managed to get a couple of useful items."

msgid "text/event_15"
msgstr "During exercises at the training ground, several tanks ran into a field scattered with dummy mines. Your dog darted ahead, drawing attention and helping the crews notice the danger in time. Thanks to your pet's quick reactions, the tanks regrouped and dealt with the obstacles safely. Whatever the outcome, a reward for such bravery is guaranteed."

msgid "text/event_16"
msgstr "While exploring the Garage, your dog sniffed out a stash of old rations hidden behind some crates. The soldiers had a good laugh at the \"treasure\" and handed it over to the quartermaster. Your dog was promised a reward for the unexpected find."

msgid "text/event_17"
msgstr "You heard a noise coming from the barracks. As you approached, you saw soldiers gathered around, watching your dog fight a huge, muscle-bound mouse. At one point, everyone got distracted by an announcement—and when they came back, the freakish rodent had vanished. In gratitude for such an entertaining spectacle, the troops gave your dog a couple of useful items."

msgid "text/event_18"
msgstr "While exploring the old command hall, your dog began barking at a dusty portrait. A little brushing, and a note fell down from behind the frame.{{br}}It spoke of a forgotten tank unit that vanished during night maneuvers—their last known call sign was Iron Paw."

msgid "text/event_19"
msgstr "During another patrol around the territory, your dog suddenly darted into the bushes and flushed out a lurking stranger. The patrol detained the intruder, and the incident was logged for further investigation."

msgid "text/event_2"
msgstr "The dog runs toward you, wagging its tail. There's a stack of papers clenched in its teeth. At first glance, they look like reports, tables, and other documentation. The guys at the office will probably be glad to have them back."

msgid "text/event_20"
msgstr "While walking around the area, your dog suddenly started barking at one of the water pipes. After technicians inspected the premises, they discovered a fault that could have led to a major system failure."

msgid "text/event_21"
msgstr "Your dog brought you a bag filled with all sorts of odd, useful things. Despite your best efforts, you couldn't figure out where it might have come from. Your four-legged friend just sat nearby, looking smug and perfectly content for the rest of the day."

msgid "text/event_22"
msgstr "The mechanics managed to teach your dog to retrieve and identify tools. The prodigious pooch spent the entire day working alongside them, confidently bringing the right gear like a seasoned crew member."

msgid "text/event_23"
msgstr "A dead tree fell on one of the guards during a patrol. Your dog not only ran to get help but also helped pull the injured man out from under the trunk. This story quickly spread among the patrol squads."

msgid "text/event_24"
msgstr "Your dog participated in an award ceremony for the most experienced tankers. The dutiful dog acted as an assistant, handing medals and gifts to the host. This contribution did not go unnoticed—it earned the pup a well-deserved reward."

msgid "text/event_25"
msgstr "Your dog returned to base carrying a torn plush fox. Some soldiers claimed they'd heard whispering in the woods shortly before.{{br}}Later that evening, one of them recognized the toy—it matched the fox emblem of a long-disbanded recon unit that vanished years ago during winter maneuvers. No records remain."

msgid "text/event_26"
msgstr "During the distribution of supplies for field training, your dog started barking aggressively. Alarmed, the officers inspected the crates and discovered that some of the equipment was live combat gear mistakenly mixed in with test batches."

msgid "text/event_27"
msgstr "During military training, your pet became obsessed with digging trenches. This enthusiasm quickly spread to the recruits, who began competing with the dog for speed and depth—much to the instructors' amusement."

msgid "text/event_28"
msgstr "Today was a home-cooking day at camp, when soldiers were allowed to prepare local dishes from available ingredients. Your dog spent the whole day running between cooking stations and helping carry supplies—earning more than a few bites from friendly hands."

msgid "text/event_29"
msgstr "Today was an important day. Your pet spent it at the hospital, cheering up the wounded by performing a few tricks you'd taught them and making sure to visit each soldier. For a while, the ward was filled with laughter and tail wags."

msgid "text/event_3"
msgstr "You watch as the dog happily helps the boys from the warehouse carry bags and other loads. At the end of the day, the grateful foreman hands you a small package as thanks for the helpful pup's work."

msgid "text/event_30"
msgstr "Today, your dog helped the often-overlooked service staff. The hardworking hound carried cleaning supplies and even tried dragging a mop across the floor without any help. Such clumsy but determined efforts lifted everyone's spirits for the rest of the day."

msgid "text/event_4"
msgstr "The dog dragged in a wooden crate filled with odd, mismatched tools. No one knows where it came from, but it looks like someone packed it deliberately."

msgid "text/event_5"
msgstr "The dog found a can with a Swedish label. Having bitten the lid, it began to mischievously run after the soldiers, who were fleeing from the can's awful smell. One of the men running past offered you a reward to stop the torment."

msgid "text/event_6"
msgstr "One of the cooks spent the whole day putting up posters about a missing kitten around the Garage. Your dog decided to help with the search and, after a few hours, found the fuzzy fugitive hiding near one of the barracks."

msgid "text/event_7"
msgstr "Your dog found a strange device and carried it around the Garage all day. Eventually, one of the mechanics recognized it as a spare tank component and carefully took it away to the workshop. The dog seemed very proud of its discovery. Whatever it turns out to be, it looks like you'll be rewarded for the find."

msgid "text/event_8"
msgstr "Tonight was a full moon. Enchanted by the moonlight, the dog howled almost nonstop until morning. The soldiers who woke up tried everything to calm the pup, but nothing seemed to work."

msgid "text/event_9"
msgstr "During testing, a fire broke out in one of the tanks. Before anyone could react, your dog darted into the burning vehicle and helped the crew escape. The story of such bravery quickly spread across the base."

